    "reviews": "\u201cMia and the Dragon Princess is a hell of an interactive cinematic experience. Wales Interactive absolutely delivers with this title, and I will most definitely be checking out their other titles.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Nerds Talking Nerdy<br><br>\u201cFor our money, this is one of the best live action adventures out there.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Xbox Tavern<br><br>\u201cI\u2019d recommend this as there\u2019s a decent uncomplicated story to scratch away at, plenty of replay value to see and hear everything, and it runs pretty slickly too\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Codec Moments<br>",
